# BusyBox init on the RNS-E 192: a shell on the screen (typed on with the
# faceplate, docs/linux.md "Rotary typing") and one on the SH-4's serial
# port (the emulator prints it; no unit has it wired to anything known).
::sysinit:/etc/init.d/rcS
tty1::respawn:-/bin/sh
ttySC1::respawn:-/bin/sh
::ctrlaltdel:/sbin/reboot
::shutdown:/bin/umount -a -r
